
---

### **.gitignore**

```plaintext
# Gradle-specific files
.gradle/
build/

# IDE-specific files
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
*.class

# Logs
logs/
*.log

# Runtime-specific files
*.pid
hs_err_pid*.log

# System files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Spring Boot-specific files
.env

# Lombok generated files
*.lombok.config

# Sensitive files
*.key
*.pem
*.crt
*.jks
secrets/
